OL,3,GNEWSASearch launched for boy, 3,
OL,4,Amissing at playground
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmergency services are looking for a
OL,7,Fthree-year-old boy who went missing at
OL,8,Fa playground.
OL,10,FPolice said Noah was at the playground
OL,11,Fat Merriam Close in Brantham, Suffolk,
OL,12,Fat about 15:00 BST, when he was
OL,13,Freported to have run down a nearby
OL,14,Falleyway towards a newbuild housing
OL,15,Festate.
OL,17,FHe is described as white, with curly
OL,18,Fginger hair, and was wearing a white
OL,19,FBluey T-shirt, shorts and white
OL,20,Ftrainers.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
